msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Sky Finance. Akiyama speaking."
msgstr "Habla Akiyama de Sky Finance."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "104_Nishihama"
msgid "Akiyama-san? I got a call from the kidnapper."
msgstr "Akiyama-san, ¿es usted? Acabo de recibir una llamada de los\nsecuestradores..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "And... Where's he want to make the exchange?"
msgstr "Mmm..., ¿dónde le pidieron entregar el dinero? "

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "128_Nishihama"
msgid "Park Boulevard... There's a taxi stand by the Kamurocho\\r\nHills construction site."
msgstr "En el bulevar del parque, por Kamurocho Hills... Me pidieron\nir a la parada de taxis que está al lado."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "A taxi stand?"
msgstr "¿Una parada de taxis?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "152_Nishihama"
msgid "Yeah, he said to put the money in a cab. Then he'll tell me\\r\nwhere my daughter is."
msgstr "Sí, me indicó que pusiera el dinero en un taxi, y que luego\nme daría la ubicación de mi hija."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "I see. Okay, then. Let's meet in front of the Millennium Tower?"
msgstr "Perfecto. Entonces, ¿nos encontramos en la Torre Millennium?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Talk_Phone_st"
msgid "I'll bring the money right over. Come to the lockers on\\r\nTaihei Boulevard."
msgstr "Traeré el dinero enseguida. Por favor, dirigete a los casilleros\\r\ndel bulevar Taihei."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "188_Nishihama"
msgid "Sure... I'll see you there."
msgstr "Estaré allí... ¡Muchas gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "A taxi stand, huh? Wonder if the kidnapper's muzzled the\\r\nguy..."
msgstr "Así que una parada de taxis... ¿El secuestrador no le habrá\nordenado guardar silencio?"

